the impact that we have

00:12:29.511 --> 00:12:32.214
every single day on so many people.

00:12:33.481 --> 00:12:36.021
You know, as you know,
when we started exploding,

00:12:36.021 --> 00:12:37.911
I was working very long days

00:12:37.911 --> 00:12:39.601
and I said to a bunch of my friends,

00:12:39.601 --> 00:12:42.641
You know, I couldn't do this anymore.

00:12:42.641 --> 00:12:44.711
If I was like in the corporate world,

00:12:44.711 --> 00:12:45.994
but at Khan Academy,

00:12:48.287 --> 00:12:50.786
the reward is pretty major.

00:12:50.786 --> 00:12:54.191
- Yeah, you know, I think
you're an example of it

00:12:54.191 --> 00:12:57.491
and everyone on the team
proudly at Khan Academy.

00:12:57.491 --> 00:12:59.741
I remember when I was working
as an analyst at a hedge fund,

00:12:59.741 --> 00:13:01.331
which is a very, I guess you could say

00:13:01.331 --> 00:13:03.661
money driven industry by definition,

00:13:03.661 --> 00:13:04.921
that's all it's driven by really.

00:13:04.921 --> 00:13:06.879
I remember reading a research study

00:13:06.879 --> 00:13:11.181
that said that actually the
top performers in a field,

00:13:11.181 --> 00:13:12.661
they aren't motivated by money.

00:13:12.661 --> 00:13:15.251
They do need enough money to
live and support their family

00:13:15.251 --> 00:13:16.821
and buy a house and go on vacations

00:13:16.821 --> 00:13:18.821
and send their kids to college
and that type of thing.

00:13:18.821 --> 00:13:21.549
But beyond that kind of sufficient level,

00:13:21.549 --> 00:13:26.549
they care much more about
impact, challenging work

00:13:27.031 --> 00:13:29.091
and being able to work
with other aligned people.

00:13:29.091 --> 00:13:31.681
And you know, the fact
that folks like yourself,

00:13:31.681 --> 00:13:33.781
and the entire team at
Khan Academy have joined

00:13:33.781 --> 00:13:35.151
I think, is evidence.

00:13:35.151 --> 00:13:37.111
I was skeptical about when
I read that paper (laughs)

00:13:37.111 --> 00:13:39.220
when I was very coin operated.

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:41.794
But I think it's absolutely true.

00:13:42.689 --> 00:13:43.601
