00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:08.243
or, you know,

00:20:08.243 --> 00:20:12.562
the company will sell
databases or whatever. (laughs)

00:20:12.562 --> 00:20:14.511
And I used to work at
Oracle, a great company,

00:20:14.511 --> 00:20:16.651
but that's how I felt about it sometimes,

00:20:16.651 --> 00:20:18.501
and that would make me
but at Khan Academy,

00:20:18.501 --> 00:20:20.601
whenever I feel like
Well, what's the big deal?

