00:21:15.561 --> 00:21:16.931
at Khan Academy every day.

00:21:16.931 --> 00:21:18.461
So that's hard.

00:21:18.461 --> 00:21:20.621
Some things have been easier.

00:21:20.621 --> 00:21:21.761
Some things have been easier.

